@BandMe_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5043

### 1. Get all seeded interest tags
GET {{BandMe_Api_HostAddress}}/api/interests
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a new Band
POST {{BandMe_Api_HostAddress}}/api/bands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend C# Builders",
  "description": "A group for developers building full-stack .NET and Blazor projects together.",
  "maxMembers": 8,
  "selectedTagIds": [1, 2]
}

### 3. Test the Questionnaire Matching endpoint
POST {{BandMe_Api_HostAddress}}/api/bands/match
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selectedTagIds": [1, 2, 6]
}

### 4. Join Band #1
POST {{BandMe_Api_HostAddress}}/api/bands/1/join

